      en: ["The Fontana della Nicchia della Conchiglia was constructed in the 17th century.", "The slope has an average gradient of approximately 12 percent.", "Water for the fountains is supplied via the ancient Aqua Paola aqueduct.", "The area is home to rare Mediterranean plant species and ancient oaks.", "The terracing of the slope also serves as essential erosion control for the hill.", "Pope Paul V initiated the comprehensive water supply project for this garden sector."],
